Track the agent lifecycle and original background mode. Make every worker
closer join its published action. Foreground requests retry transient
connection errors against the network; background requests retain the
cached error and its configured backoff.

Read activity and enqueue disconnection events in the same STM transaction
so shutdown releases callbacks blocked by a full event queue. Include the
local XFTP completion worker in worker diagnostics.

